00:25:21.188 --> 00:25:23.565
Right. So, get that in there.

498
00:25:23.649 --> 00:25:24.650
Come on.

499
00:25:24.733 --> 00:25:27.361
Already burning the midnight oil,
I see, Ted.

500
00:25:27.444 --> 00:25:28.654
Well, as the man once said,

501
00:25:28.737 --> 00:25:31.323
"The harder you work,
the luckier you get," huh?

502
00:25:32.199 --> 00:25:33.200
On the diagonal.

503
00:25:33.283 --> 00:25:35.244
My apologies, Ted.
We should have ordered you a car.

504
00:25:35.327 --> 00:25:36.662
Oh, no. That's okay.

505
00:25:36.745 --> 00:25:37.829
-Night, y'all.
-Got it.

506
00:25:41.375 --> 00:25:42.376
What is wrong with you?

507
00:25:42.459 --> 00:25:44.586
It's just that everything
I've eaten today...

508
00:25:45.546 --> 00:25:47.464
feels like it's stuck right here.

509
00:25:49.508 --> 00:25:50.759
I got it. I got it.

510
00:25:52.803 --> 00:25:53.804
Here we go.

511
00:25:53.887 --> 00:25:57.182
He seems like such a nice man.
I'm not sure I can do this.

512
00:25:59.142 --> 00:26:00.394
Obviously, for this to work,

513
00:26:00.477 --> 00:26:04.857
I'm going to need the full support
of my new director of football operations.

514
00:26:05.858 --> 00:26:08.277
I'm assuming that's a promotion
and substantial pay rise

515
00:26:08.360 --> 00:26:10.863
that would be of interest to you
and your family.

516
00:26:13.407 --> 00:26:15.534
Hey, look, this car's got
an invisible steering wheel!

517
00:26:17.703 --> 00:26:18.662
I'm just kidding.

518
00:26:18.745 --> 00:26:20.455
It's my man Nate here running the horn.

519
00:26:20.539 --> 00:26:23.166
You're a godsend, Ted Lasso.

520
00:26:23.250 --> 00:26:25.085
Takes one to know one.

521
00:26:29.756 --> 00:26:30.757
Well?

522
00:26:32.092 --> 00:26:33.302
I accept.

523
00:26:33.385 --> 00:26:34.511
Wonderful.

524
00:26:40.475 --> 00:26:42.144
Oh, and Higgins,

525
00:26:42.227 --> 00:26:45.022
I know that there'll be elements
to this little adventure

526
00:26:45.105 --> 00:26:46.398
that will weigh on you a bit.

527
00:26:46.481 --> 00:26:48.734
But I'm sure it won't be harder
than it was

528
00:26:48.817 --> 00:26:51.820
to sneak all Rupert's women in and out
behind my back all those years.

529
00:27:07.169 --> 00:27:08.295
This is you, Coach.

530
00:27:09.338 --> 00:27:11.548
Okay. All right. You good?

531
00:27:11.632 --> 00:27:13.217
-I'm good. You good?
-Yeah.

532
00:27:13.300 --> 00:27:14.468
-Night, Coach.
-Good night, Coach.

533
00:27:14.551 --> 00:27:16.011
I almost forgot.

534
00:27:17.304 --> 00:27:18.805
What's this for?

535
00:27:18.889 --> 00:27:20.557
-"Into touch."
-Get some sleep, Coach.

536
00:27:20.641 --> 00:27:21.850
Yeah, I will.

537
00:28:09.106 --> 00:28:11.567
Hey, big guy. How you doing?
How was school today?

538
00:28:12.943 --> 00:28:13.861
Right.

539
00:28:13.944 --> 00:28:15.529
No, I forgot.

540
00:28:15.612 --> 00:28:17.865
Yeah. Yeah, I'm a little loopy today.

541
00:28:18.866 --> 00:28:20.784
Yeah. Yeah, you could say that.

542
00:28:22.369 --> 00:28:24.788
No, no, that's okay. No.
I just wanted to hear your voice.

543
00:28:24.872 --> 00:28:26.415
Yeah. Yeah, go do your thing. Yeah.

544
00:28:26.498 --> 00:28:28.083
Hey, is your mom there?

545
00:28:28.166 --> 00:28:30.252
Okay. Thanks, big guy.

546
00:28:30.335 --> 00:28:31.420
Hey, I miss you.

547
00:28:34.047 --> 00:28:35.549
Yeah, I love you too.

548
00:28:36.258 --> 00:28:37.259
Okay.

549
00:28:46.768 --> 00:28:48.103
Hey, how you doing?

550
00:28:48.770 --> 00:28:51.440
Yeah. Well, you know,
so far so good. You know?

551
00:28:52.858 --> 00:28:55.194
It's gonna take
some getting used to, yeah.

552
00:28:55.277 --> 00:28:57.946
But I think once we get going,
it's gonna go all right.

553
00:28:58.864 --> 00:29:01.408
Yeah. No, that's true, that's true. Yeah.

554
00:29:02.326 --> 00:29:04.995
Well, you know what?
It's actually pretty nice. Yeah.

555
00:29:06.163 --> 00:29:08.832
Yeah, and tell you what,
they got a cute neighborhood too.

556
00:29:08.916 --> 00:29:09.917
Yeah.

557
00:29:10.000 --> 00:29:12.377
Yeah, you and the little guy
gotta get on over here.

558
00:29:12.461 --> 00:29:13.629
Come check it out.

559
00:29:18.634 --> 00:29:19.927
What? No, what did I say?

560
00:29:23.472 --> 00:29:26.141
But that's what I'm doing though.
I'm giving you that space.

561
00:29:27.768 --> 00:29:28.769
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

562
00:29:28.852 --> 00:29:30.354
Yeah, and myself. Right.

563
00:29:32.648 --> 00:29:33.690
Okay.

564
00:29:34.441 --> 00:29:36.443
No, no. That's okay. Yeah, yeah.

565
00:29:36.527 --> 00:29:37.778
Hey, Michelle.

566
00:29:39.404 --> 00:29:40.405
I love you.

567
00:29:44.409 --> 00:29:46.370
No, no, that's okay. You don't have to.

568
00:29:47.621 --> 00:29:49.623
Really. Yeah.

569
00:29:52.501 --> 00:29:53.585
Okay.

570
00:29:55.963 --> 00:29:57.756
All right, now. Good night.

571
00:30:15.274 --> 00:30:17.943
Shoot. Now I can't sleep.

